{"id":1141102,"name":"ピクセル・取り調べⅡ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"ピクセル・取り調べⅡ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1141102]}],"trial":{"trial_id":141102,"stage":"段階2","unlock_time":"2026-08-07 14:00:00","diary1":"ピクセルが作り出したゲーム『学術人生』の中で、あなたは貧しい学生となり、期待と憧れを胸にニューシティでトップの学校へと足を踏み入れ、新たな大学生活をスタートさせた。","diary2":"ゲームの終盤になって初めて、あなたは「正誤」の境界線がとっくに曖昧になっていることに気付く――原則と本心を貫いた人こそが真っ先に脱落し、追い詰められたのは、終始誰よりも全てを正しくこなそうとした人だった。\n　そして、それこそがピクセルの歩んできた人生なのだ。目の前にいるこの狂気じみた変人も、かつては努力すれば報われると信じていた「優等生」だった。\n　あなたは言葉にできないほど複雑な思いを抱き、長く口を閉ざした。","evidence":[{"ID":260965,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260966,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":3,"dialogue_id":241102008,"next":[9,10]},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102009,"next":[8]},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241102022,"next":null},{"step":23,"co